# Real participant data -- Prolific exports and compute_bonus.py's own
# output both contain real Participant/Submission IDs paired with real
# payment amounts. Never tracked, regardless of exact filename -- these
# patterns cover Prolific's own export naming and compute_bonus.py's
# default output naming, but ANY file with real participant data in this
# directory should never be committed, named like this or not.
prolific_*export*.csv
prolific_demographic_export_*.csv
